{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-35b2e221aa1e","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-35b2e221aa1e","name":"蒜蓉炒芹菜","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E8%92%9C%E8%93%89%E7%82%92%E8%8A%B9%E8%8F%9C/%E8%92%9C%E8%93%89%E7%82%92%E8%8A%B9%E8%8F%9C.md","blob_sha":"0f5146096c20f031a51664a5d57755a2ad161d3d","details":{"introduction":"蒜蓉炒芹菜是一道清脆爽口、蒜香浓郁的家常快手素菜。芹菜富含膳食纤维、维生素 K 和钾元素。这道菜的灵魂在于「脆」——大火快炒半分钟即出锅，口感脆生生的，一口咬下去还有汁水。从备料到出锅大约只需 10 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"* 芹菜（香芹最佳）\n* 猪油（没有可用食用油替代，但猪油风味更佳）\n* 蒜\n* 盐"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n* 香芹 300 g（约 2 大把）\n* 蒜 4 瓣，切末\n* 猪油 15 ml\n* 盐 2 g"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 芹菜摘去大部分叶子，只保留少量嫩叶。如果梗部较粗，纵向剖开一刀使其粗细一致，然后切成不超过 5 cm 的段（约大拇指长度，太长容易卡嗓子）\n2. 蒜切成蒜末，备用\n3. 芹菜段入锅前尽可能沥干水分，甩得越干越好\n4. 炒锅烧热，放入 15 ml 猪油，油热后先撒入 2 g 盐\n5. 放入蒜末，小火炒 10 秒煸香\n6. **转大火**，倒入芹菜段，快速翻炒 **30 秒**，立即出锅\n7. 出锅标准：芹菜看起来**半生不熟**、颜色翠绿、没有炒软塌，这时的口感最脆"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"* 芹菜选香芹（细梗品种）最佳，口感最脆嫩。普通芹菜也可以，但梗粗的需要纵向切细\n* **大火快炒是关键**，芹菜下锅到出锅不超过 1 分钟。炒久了会变软变蔫，失去脆生的口感\n* 芹菜下锅前一定要尽量沥干水，水分太多会降低锅温，导致变成「煮」而不是「炒」\n* 用猪油炒比食用油更香，如果没有猪油，食用油也可替代"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：芹菜400g、去皮大蒜15g、大豆食用油15g、食盐3g；整份约320g。按原文允许的植物油替代猪油，普通芹菜可食茎。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":65.921875,"protein_g":1.160625,"carbohydrate_g":5.264062,"fat_g":4.923438},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169988/nutrients","version":"6d8f290bf49417bc","fdc_ids":[169988,169230,171411,173468]},"profile_id":"family-35b2e221aa1e-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-35b2e221aa1e","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-35b2e221aa1e","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-35b2e221aa1e-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"celery","grams":400},{"key":"garlic","grams":15},{"key":"oil","grams":15},{"key":"salt","grams":3}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"6d8f290bf49417bc","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-35b2e221aa1e-v1.bc1d7a7552e929a9.json","bytes":20455,"sha256":"bc1d7a7552e929a9a5949430ae1dfdd1317310d57ab25098df9f422ed6a6fa7e"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-35b2e221aa1e-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-35b2e221aa1e","recipe_blob_sha":"0f5146096c20f031a51664a5d57755a2ad161d3d","version":"1","data_version":"6d8f290bf49417bc","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":320,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品320g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：芹菜400g、去皮大蒜15g、大豆食用油15g、食盐3g；整份约320g。按原文允许的植物油替代猪油，普通芹菜可食茎。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-35b2e221aa1e","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-35b2e221aa1e-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"celery","grams":400},{"key":"garlic","grams":15},{"key":"oil","grams":15},{"key":"salt","grams":3}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":65.921875,"protein_g":1.160625,"carbohydrate_g":5.264062,"fat_g":4.923438},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169988/nutrients","version":"6d8f290bf49417bc","fdc_ids":[169988,169230,171411,173468]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":true,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-35b2e221aa1e-v1.bc1d7a7552e929a9.json","bytes":20455,"sha256":"bc1d7a7552e929a9a5949430ae1dfdd1317310d57ab25098df9f422ed6a6fa7e"}}]}
